OL,3,GNEWSAMurder suspect found dead in
OL,4,Aprison
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was charged with murdering
OL,7,Fhis housemate in Worcestershire has
OL,8,Fbeen found dead in prison, according to
OL,9,Fpolice.
OL,11,FThe body of Pawel Jezierski, 46, of
OL,12,FWylds Lane, Worcester, was discovered
OL,13,Fat HMP Hewell on Wednesday evening.
OL,15,FHe was arrested after a body was found
OL,16,Fat his home last week, believed to be
OL,17,F42-year-old Damian Buczek.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
