OL,3,GNEWSAMurder suspect found dead in
OL,4,Aprison
OL,5,
OL,6,FA West Mercia Police spokesperson said:
OL,7,F"There is not believed to be any
OL,8,Fthird-party involvement in his death
OL,9,Fand a report will be prepared for the
OL,10,Fcoroner."
